<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Coates ups interim shr, div steady.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Coates ups interim shr, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		 18.4	vs    17.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   2.5	vs    2.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    6.47	vs    5.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   10.43	vs    9.82</p>
<p>    Tax			  3.91	vs    3.82</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    1.30	vs    1.42</p>
<p>    Turnover		 161.41	vs    141.27</p>
<p>Div payable October 15</p>
<p>on register September 12</p>
<p>Full name: Coates Brothers (South Africa) Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said forecasts for economic growth for th esecond half of the year were generally lower than the first half. Therefore the company's earnings for the year are projected to be only marginally ahead of those for 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
